{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "84cdc28227305ebec241e09d2c0957a9c9d2a89a07c14a202fe498b1c07c7189", "ja": "夢を束ねたステージへ", "zh": "迈向梦想汇聚的舞台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7d520129cc48043c5086869d36b0cb47255a0eedfc53d911379fe17adc289950", "ja": "見事に全員のアイディアをまとめた\nステージ計画を作り上げてみせた\nこのみ。メンバーは驚きつつも喜び、\nついに本番のステージへと駆け上がった。", "zh": "木实完美整合了所有人的点子，\n完成了整个舞台的企划。\n成员个个又惊又喜，\n终于登上了正式演出的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1000_019min", "source_sha256": "4ae42de103d56cb58ab68b756ff9466d91b443088254947e3f3f787bce9a88f9", "ja": "はい、柔軟体操おわり！　汗をふいたら、振り付けの\n確認から……あっ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "好，柔软操结束！擦完汗以后，开始确认舞步……\n啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "fc4687a3310141ba06b5fad39c25dc36368315bb01f34928bb7e3b4aaa57697d", "ja": "おつかれさま美奈子。レッスンも佳境だな。\n調子はどうだ？", "zh": "美奈子，辛苦你了。课程也渐入佳境了呢。\n大家的状况如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "7fc67403c0fb29b7128004ea8871d4e300104f538e5aba6298da71bd61ca506f", "ja": "もう、ばっちりです！　育ちゃんもひなたちゃんも、\nあれから、めきめき上達してますし♪", "zh": "非常完美！小育和日向从那之后，\n表现就突飞猛进♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "5b9d1638f7438762f21bbc236bd88dfa79bb14d6d994163166e7808b37f36c14", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nあの、それで、このみさんは……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n请问，木实姊人呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0c48543b6cf67d15f41c1a87f658cc600320caad24998ee8292b7455b96d1c37", "ja": "ああ、朝から事務室で缶詰になりながら、\nみんなのコンセプトをまとめようとしてたが……。", "zh": "啊，她一早就把自己关在事务室，\n要把大家提的主题整合起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "cfd7b94107df8373a191eb8bc4ac3a3cf4655d3597af5689dbb53cf2ad1425d7", "ja": "みんな……！　い、いる！？　いるわよね！？", "zh": "大家……！在、在吗！？都在对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "f2e6159cabadc97ebc8cdcde822c70971900ddfcb27b60bdfe2333a9bb594f4b", "ja": "ついに……ついにできたわよ！\n私たち『ミックスナッツ』のコンセプトが！", "zh": "我终于……终于完成了！\n只属于我们『Mix Nuts』的主题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "db4ac313c64a6e4fcc8ddf925411cdfd3934d5b01e4a444506c30583d7200d85", "ja": "ほんとう！？", "zh": "真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "d85cc9bd6bb3469c006e8b3c5bba9fb06c1f9c36f83d0cdcd0f552666f90e8b8", "ja": "このみさん、聞かせて欲しいべさ。", "zh": "木实姊，请你跟我们说哪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "da6849e1efa3589be3655c988ef9c66aaa733452869409806d498cb5e57ba39c", "ja": "いいわ……よく聞いて。", "zh": "好……听清楚啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "100c640c6e2c018138eccaa40b0b490b1ab2933e6165c44438a82632191750e6", "ja": "ゴクリ…………！", "zh": "（吞口水）…………！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "100c640c6e2c018138eccaa40b0b490b1ab2933e6165c44438a82632191750e6", "ja": "ゴクリ…………！", "zh": "（吞口水）…………！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "100c640c6e2c018138eccaa40b0b490b1ab2933e6165c44438a82632191750e6", "ja": "ゴクリ…………！", "zh": "（吞口水）…………！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "100c640c6e2c018138eccaa40b0b490b1ab2933e6165c44438a82632191750e6", "ja": "ゴクリ…………！", "zh": "（吞口水）…………！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0bcb27e80e4da2d719a8a3a0633bbd420525fb4a56f5dd9cc77887fff17a6999", "ja": "（メンバー5人が、自由に生み出したコンセプト。\nいったい、どんな風にまとめたのか……）", "zh": "（由五名成员自由提出来的主题，\n究竟会整合成什么样的内容呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "a7dd836d41be86d46fdba27c7cf54e62da82ffc59fc7c88ed8c1063fe4a59b4c", "ja": "ミックスナッツのコンセプトは、\nこの5人が出したコンセプト……。その、全部よ！", "zh": "『Mix Nuts』的主题，\n就是我们五人想出来的……全部的主题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "b7397e4741f87add98f30fcb05bec618e1d00bcbf19800588c6f2c9b397be861", "ja": "ぜ、全部！？　このみん、本気……！？", "zh": "全、全部！？木木，你说真的吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "93f8e10a78bbc3ac488d75e8f10b7e58f2d130adbb4aa7609723cd08b09d51e6", "ja": "ええ。まず、美奈子ちゃんの『おいしい\nご飯でおなかいっぱいディナーライブ』だけど。", "zh": "没错，首先是美奈子提的\n『用美味料理饱餐一顿的晚餐演唱会』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "162a88211836c9650cc800e566131d1526a0259d50cf84a9462a7df41be2b119", "ja": "エントランスに、『出張！　佐竹飯店』を作るわ！\nどうかしら、{$P$}。", "zh": "我们在大厅做一个『快闪店！佐竹饭店』吧！\n{$P$}，你觉得如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3650285d249b180c433cbfb3af62830cb3a01d9c55642883b94106e6b9462e08", "ja": "それだったら……対応可能ですね！　すごいですよ\nこのみさん！　あ、でも、美奈子はどう思う？", "zh": "那样的话……确实行得通！木实，你真是太厉害了！\n啊，不过美奈子你怎么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "f7b9abf7184a37631b0070e87f97ec18e31054e4227ba1e64f07469e33202778", "ja": "わ……。", "zh": "哇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7b123f51248887f1a0877e6724d5627ae2b7e6880e1b5161cd8e24f7946a8a2e", "ja": "わ？", "zh": "哇？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "d02ca18d9e7a59535609f5a53d8925644189caa682dd5e497c664f6b62b014da", "ja": "わっほーい！！　素敵ですっ！　ライブ前と後に、\nたっぷりカロリーがとれるんですねっ！！", "zh": "哇哦──！！太棒了！这样在演唱会的前后，\n就能摄取满满的卡路里了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "fa56a2c35e8bda36ec9c419588153c68825f37cbf6480e4d14c7ec291d1ecd80", "ja": "私、さっそく食べやすいメニューを考えてきます！　肉\nまんとか、春巻とか、チンジャオロースティックとか！", "zh": "我这就去想一些方便食用的菜单！\n像是肉包、春卷、青椒肉卷之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1024_p", "source_sha256": "1d5558cd4e63c9cf72dc278d428671b7484ee2a70afd09dadb8a03a4da63bba0", "ja": "はは、もしかしたら劇場の名物になるかもしれないな。\n楽しみにしてるぞ、美奈子！", "zh": "哈哈，这说不定会变成我们剧场的特产呢。\n我很期待喔，美奈子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "5341c5c096c11ff5483fa9ffec73609aec74273968728cddfbc426eb8236fe12", "ja": "次は育ちゃんの『動物いっぱいライブ』と\nひなたちゃんの『お花いっぱいライブ』ね！", "zh": "接着是小育的『动物大集合演唱会』\n跟日向的『花儿朵朵开演唱会』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "6cd7b196541d7f110cd9a90e39504b13cf0d510cba87e7d587534da304d49db4", "ja": "動物いっぱいライブは、育ちゃんの提案を採用して、\n私たち5人が動物になりきってトークする形にするわ。", "zh": "动物大集合演唱会就采用小育的提议，\n由我们五人扮演动物跟观众进行互动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "da7b03c6c227340aa9add89bd96b17a4b13c62e5e9376d8e5745413544ee0d46", "ja": "歌の合間のミニコーナーになると思うけど、\nかわいさに、ファンは大喜び間違いなしよ！", "zh": "这应该会是歌与歌之间的小单元，\n粉丝看到我们这么可爱肯定会很高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1028_030iku", "source_sha256": "5d6d6a37b9776c0e98863e687071b42e5bfaf46fb75e7ac7975090bb06ca1177", "ja": "えへへ、みんなといっしょにかわいい動物さんになって\nおしゃべりできるなんて、すっごく楽しみ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，居然可以和大家一起变成\n可爱的动物谈天说笑，我好期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "25549008582ba7bdfd6674a7e55ab4a940be70fa5018dc63dfecebb9f155d830", "ja": "確かに、あれはとてもかわいらしかったな。\n育の動物ステージ、期待してるぞ？", "zh": "上次那个确实非常可爱呢。\n我很看好育的动物表演喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1030_030iku", "source_sha256": "ec5ac78ad3b91838cd7615cfb99739dcfde6e1e55d1ae80148d23e532304b22a", "ja": "うん！　{$P$}さんは安心して\nみててね。わたし、上手にできるから。", "zh": "嗯！{$P$}先生就放心看着吧。\n我一定会让表演成功的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "51fec0efc8fb6f3a782ca9b152eae989f720c77bfc0b598bfc371572712305b9", "ja": "お花いっぱいライブも、ひなたちゃんの案でいくわ！\n紙の花吹雪を客席に大量に降らせましょう。", "zh": "花儿朵朵开演唱会也是照日向的点子进行！\n我们一起用纸片撒满整个观众席吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "71312979bae19fe9843cf88ba2fd8672472ce00ed40b6dcb9d9a6ad939f0ceb8", "ja": "色違いの紙を何種類も集めて紙吹雪を作れば、\nきっと満開の花畑みたいになると思うのよね。", "zh": "只要准备几种不同颜色的纸片，\n看起来肯定会像是盛开的花田。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "0b5748a47409e329507c9499e9e86077b5e51c3876015d1fab0be31fdb1e8431", "ja": "わあ……！　あたしが考えたアイディアよりも\nステキになってるべさ。ありがとうねえ、このみさん。", "zh": "哇……！这比我原先想的点子还棒哪。\n真是多谢呢～木实姊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "d08d87ff3be5345f3975fcaf4ca0d5c4626a13622480a51da06b15b81952050c", "ja": "花の香りに関しては、可憐ちゃんにオススメのアロマを\nいくつかきいてきたから、みんなで選びましょう！", "zh": "至于花香，我去找可怜问了几款不错的精油，\n大家一起来选吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1035_035hin", "source_sha256": "63e49c97460025529ec96b121423fc2b78d9f34ce62eac38a56a59c7ae1a0a1b", "ja": "アロマの香りがする紙吹雪なんて、おしゃれだねえ。\nすっごいライブになりそうだよぉ！", "zh": "散发着香气的纸片，感觉好浪漫呢～\n这一定会是一场超棒的演唱会哪～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1036_039kon", "source_sha256": "dbb69f20d1678fa76fd48f1dc21bb6c002973e2f27a7ff33d652b89974d7e34e", "ja": "さて、最後は、真美ちゃんの宇宙空間ライブね……！", "zh": "那么，最后就是真美提的外太空演唱会了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1037_012mam", "source_sha256": "a5f974473e2f6319dc03eeb92156242f182a5ebfb6dda87a2c783d51177d6373", "ja": "このみん……真美のために、ついに宇宙船を\nレンタルしてくれたんだね！？　ありがとう！！", "zh": "木木……你为了真美，\n终于决定要去租太空船了吗！？谢谢你！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1038_039kon", "source_sha256": "b3c20e88a61e0e4ecffedfd6f25837da11e41fff5b6fd8e48cd751e92985e95c", "ja": "それはさすがに、ムリだったわ。\n美咲ちゃんの力をもってしてもね……。", "zh": "那是真的太强人所难了，\n即便动用美咲的关系也办不到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1039_p", "source_sha256": "f50f9ef6d682ec36588d1ec1206d482ae96d2ce36f1b17de69f1bbf662f97fea", "ja": "（試してはみたんだ……？）", "zh": "（你还真的去问了……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1040_012mam", "source_sha256": "9428ad84b6f07da34bb8631b8c1dfb5754a7ccfeee2bddf7be95822021483586", "ja": "え～っ、真美のアイディアも採用してよ～！\nファンの兄ちゃん姉ちゃんの頭の上で泳ぎたいよ～！！", "zh": "怎么这样～真美的点子也要采用啦～！\n人家想在粉丝大哥哥大姊姊的头上漫步啦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1041_039kon", "source_sha256": "2fabbaf28e731f8de3868ca1240d5a55ca0b356cfccfa3b84f28d139ab9f5e9b", "ja": "ふっふっふっ……宇宙に連れていくのはムリだけど\nその希望をかなえる方法ならあるのよ……劇場にね！", "zh": "呵呵呵……我虽然没有办法带你到外太空，\n但我知道怎样能实现你的愿望……在剧场里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1042_039kon", "source_sha256": "4b7986ce9d9c05bd32dc2ce682aa86d73506a9d498ccb717702d40b1717fec17", "ja": "それはずばり、ワイヤーアクションよ！", "zh": "答案就是，吊钢丝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1043_012mam", "source_sha256": "2379a078d251425f11c0892750dee2b277a7c2fed71d06e40d2f2a82900cb828", "ja": "えっ、それって「アチョー！」とか「アイヤ！」とか、\n「あいきゃんふらい！」とか言っちゃうアレ！？", "zh": "咦？你是说会喊「啊打～！」、「喝呀！」、\n「I can fly！」的那个吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1044_039kon", "source_sha256": "ad798c642e0f52e599b369a074f2bf765446679dd43d5a0d5d751824af470461", "ja": "よくわからないけど、たぶんソレよっ！\nワイヤーに吊られて客席の上を飛び回るの！", "zh": "虽然我听不是很懂，但应该就是那个了！\n就用吊钢丝的方式在观众席上方来回穿梭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1045_039kon", "source_sha256": "37e8fcbcc63dc84468e32aaacc427985e68e7367804bd6c45c5355355d7476ac", "ja": "5人全員で飛び回って、ファンの頭の上から紙花吹雪を\n降らせてもいいし、生歌もきかせられるかもね！", "zh": "五个人一起当空中飞人，可以在粉丝的头上\n撒下纸片，说不定还能现场唱歌给他们听呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1046_012mam", "source_sha256": "8ea50a635141541ca5ed600b9c94d7c0b96190df58f6368da8900c7811c9c766", "ja": "おぉ……なにそれ、めっちゃ楽しそうっぽい！\nこのみん！　真美、ワイヤレスフォンしてみるよ！！", "zh": "喔喔……天呀，听起来超好玩的！\n木木！真美要试着用无线耳机！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1047_p", "source_sha256": "f8089a90868ff483ab0218a58df88fa51fbaee6f6cd5d7088d7f1f599b909a2b", "ja": "驚きました、このみさん、本当にメンバー全員の\n希望をかなえるコンセプトにしたんですね。", "zh": "真是惊人，木实，你真的将所有人的想法\n整合成一个主题了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1048_039kon", "source_sha256": "3f6023c324b6908b3f44982b8eb11b26aa764aa63c7d0d42e262c1093dcff277", "ja": "そう言ってもらえると、徹夜したかいがあったわ。\n時間はかかったけど、いいまとめになったでしょ？", "zh": "听到你这么说，就没有枉费我忙通宵了。\n虽然花了不少时间，但最后的结果还不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1049_039kon", "source_sha256": "dd105be3f899dd83d22f167ada7627f9b3aeaecf9712a8e7af5a9f13b1be64f6", "ja": "出張佐竹飯店に、動物MC、紙の花吹雪、ワイヤー\nアクションの宇宙遊泳……そして、セクシーな私！", "zh": "佐竹饭店快闪店、动物主持、落花纸片、\n吊钢丝太空漫步……以及，性感的我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1050_039kon", "source_sha256": "02588f4dcdc4536fd353d9996b6c8053d0b664bb04130a2afd92fa7fa7fe5e66", "ja": "ふふ、完璧すぎて怖いくらい。これで私たちミックス\nナッツの公演は空前絶後のすごいライブになるわっ！", "zh": "呵呵，完美到我都怕了。这样我们『Mix Nuts』\n的公演肯定会是一场空前绝后的演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1051_p", "source_sha256": "a344209777ff5b1b2368d537f361826a756aeeeaed35ff22ba928e7b80a4f333", "ja": "（すばらしいコンセプトが決まり、\nみんなの目が希望に輝いている……！）", "zh": "（敲定了这么精彩的主题，\n每个人眼中都闪着希望的光辉……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1052_p", "source_sha256": "ed9a7af9765edf9a20ca866309ae9bb996a3de67cb6fb9083fcdbf8d8ccd1713", "ja": "（本番に向けて、レッスンにも一層熱が入りそうだ！\n俺も最後まで気をぬかず、準備を進めていこう！）", "zh": "（公演在即，大家练习时也更投入了！\n我也是，直到最后都不能松懈，要确实做好准备！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1053_null", "source_sha256": "74e2f1213f9876ea26246041baa07f626fb1fe2ba8fbc0e69a8ccd4f3fba2faa", "ja": "そして、本番当日……", "zh": "接着，到了公演当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1054_035hin", "source_sha256": "f4cadb1973723300d68cf08129e269be76e0455d90c00b1f10d011214353233f", "ja": "……こっそり客席をのぞいてみたっけ、お客さんいっぱ\nいだったべさ……なまら緊張してきたよぉ。", "zh": "……我刚刚偷看了一下观众席，\n来了好多客人哪……我现在特紧张的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1055_030iku", "source_sha256": "ede4f561b2e5da56c5ea206e75e9c1529087e7d85ea6cd5f0207d94e67b07da3", "ja": "うん、わたしもドキドキするけど、楽しみだよっ。\nひなたちゃんがこわくなったら、助けてあげるね！", "zh": "嗯，我虽然也很紧张，但也很期待喔！\n日向要是觉得害怕，我会帮你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1056_019min", "source_sha256": "ac2d8b817b5fc5b39a09737caa06173ab7e4114d13da84e82c181e1c6ecc24d5", "ja": "私たちなら、大丈夫！　ファンのみんなが美味しく\n食べて、楽しんで帰れるように、精一杯やろうっ！", "zh": "我们一定没问题的！为了让来场的粉丝吃得尽兴、\n看得满足再回家，让我们拿出全力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1057_p", "source_sha256": "9a30c35c20617d2b9dab5a1f963ef7d43352ce67f960d133e60db30f25463663", "ja": "……みんな。今のミックスナッツは、最初に俺が言った\n通り、メンバー全員が主役のユニットになったと思う。", "zh": "……各位，我觉得现在的『Mix Nuts』已经成为\n我当初说的，所有成员都是主角的团体了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1058_p", "source_sha256": "1ae25e2b586d848dab800b9842a264f92332248c2961e8f272ce7fc124cf65f8", "ja": "胸を張っていいし、ここまで力を合わせて団結してくれ\nたみんなを、プロデューサーとして誇りに思うぞ！", "zh": "你们可以为此自豪，而看着你们合力团结至今，\n我身为制作人更是为你们感到骄傲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1059_012mam", "source_sha256": "284e2f5261f5a444e1ebc6e1a4f93947c4f286d4137713a24b813114c56b3548", "ja": "えへへ♪　まあ兄ちゃんがいなかったら、真美たち\nもっといっぱい困ったと思うけど！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪要是没有大哥哥在的话，\n真美我们肯定会遇上更多困扰呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1060_039kon", "source_sha256": "10d66527b131976526239cf188da6efd0534409242999d434fe008b0bca1d98c", "ja": "ええ、私もそう思うわ。支えてくれてありがとう、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "嗯，我也这么觉得。谢谢你一直在背后支持我们，\n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1061_039kon", "source_sha256": "652ce88843afd3b3cc313dce36b35a3f5c12fba9a73463fb4912f9b3f1fdfa22", "ja": "さあ、いよいよ本番ね！　ミックスナッツ全員の\n愛と元気とセクシーで、ステージを盛り上げましょう！", "zh": "好，公演就要开始了！用『Mix Nuts』全员的\n爱、活力与性感，炒热整个舞台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1062_039kon", "source_sha256": "a0321a4b8926c62cc49ce2449fd55f5070a6faa149bfc3c46e2668eb0e939f31", "ja": "ミックスナッツ、出発進行ー！", "zh": "『Mix Nuts』，全体出击──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0015_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0015_story_06_1063_039kon", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
